OL,3,GNEWSALast chance to view cemetery
OL,4,Amausoleum plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople can still have their say on
OL,7,Fplans to build six mausoleum blocks at
OL,8,Fa cemetery in Surrey.
OL,10,FPlans for the new community mausoleums
OL,11,Fat Brookwood Cemetery went on show at
OL,12,Fthe start of the month in the North
OL,13,FCemetery Chapel and can be viewed until
OL,14,FSunday.
OL,16,FAvril Kirby, manager of Brookwood
OL,17,FCemetery, said there was growing demand
OL,18,Ffor above-ground interment, adding:
OL,19,F"Our existing community mausoleums are
OL,20,Fnow fully subscribed, with all chambers
OL,21,Feither occupied or reserved."
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
